{"id":"b961a724325c53e7","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-graph-characterization.md","title":"逻辑对彩色图及图类的刻画","display":"df-graph-characterization — 逻辑对彩色图及图类的刻画","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-graph-characterization","aliases":["29-df-graph-characterization"],"display":"df-graph-characterization — 逻辑对彩色图及图类的刻画","depends_on":["[[29-df-colored-graph]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]","[[29-df-ck]]","[[29-df-assignment]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 12.3, p.182, DjVu scan 197; C^k interface p.187, scan 202","source_basis":"原书刻画定义已核对文本层；以有限颜色词汇族重构无限颜色记法，C^k 实例采用本库单排序接口"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-graph-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-graph-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-characterization — 逻辑对彩色图及图类的刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 12.3, p.182, DjVu scan 197; C^k interface p.187, scan 202"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书刻画定义已核对文本层；以有限颜色词汇族重构无限颜色记法，C^k 实例采用本库单排序接口"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_s=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_s^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_s=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_s^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span> 为元语言结构性质类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(\\mathcal S_s,M_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal L=(\\mathcal S_s,M_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是给定逻辑的元语言语义接口：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_s\">\\(\\mathcal S_s\\)</span> 为词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_s\">\\(\\tau_s\\)</span> 的句子集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_s\\subseteq\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\times\\mathcal S_s\">\\(M_s\\subseteq\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\times\\mathcal S_s\\)</span> 为其句子满足类。此处结构类与满足类不假定是集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}\">\\(\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau_s]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau_s]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_C\">\\(\\models_C\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span> 见所列依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_k\">\\(\\mathsf C_k\\)</span> 是单排序固定整数阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span> 在全部有限颜色词汇上的语义接口；句子满足使用全赋值并与其选择无关。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\mathcal L,s}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_s\\;\\bigl((A,\\varphi)\\in M_s\\leftrightarrow(B,\\varphi)\\in M_s\\bigr),\\qquad A,B\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\mathcal L,s}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_s\\;\\bigl((A,\\varphi)\\in M_s\\leftrightarrow(B,\\varphi)\\in M_s\\bigr),\\qquad A,B\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Char}_{\\mathcal L,r}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\geq r\\;\\forall G&#39;,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}(G,G&#39;)\\land G&#39;\\equiv_{\\mathcal L,s}H\\to G&#39;\\cong H\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Char}_{\\mathcal L,r}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\geq r\\;\\forall G&#39;,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}(G,G&#39;)\\land G&#39;\\equiv_{\\mathcal L,s}H\\to G&#39;\\cong H\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CharClass}_{\\mathcal L,r}(\\mathcal K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall G\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\operatorname{Char}_{\\mathcal L,r}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CharClass}_{\\mathcal L,r}(\\mathcal K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall G\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\operatorname{Char}_{\\mathcal L,r}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_s^{C_k}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau_s],\\qquad\nM_s^{C_k}\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\times\\mathcal S_s^{C_k}\\mid\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_C\\varphi[\\beta]\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf C_k\\coloneqq(\\mathcal S_s^{C_k},M_s^{C_k})_{s\\in\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_s^{C_k}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau_s],\\qquad\nM_s^{C_k}\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\times\\mathcal S_s^{C_k}\\mid\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_C\\varphi[\\beta]\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf C_k\\coloneqq(\\mathcal S_s^{C_k},M_s^{C_k})_{s\\in\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.3，印刷页182、扫描页197，要求对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的每一种着色扩张和任意比较图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>，逻辑等价均推出同构。不能只在某个固定着色下区分原图，也不能把比较图限制为同一待刻画图类。本条把原书可数颜色总词汇拆成任意有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\geq r\">\\(s\\geq r\\)</span> 的词汇，和本库有限 Vocabulary 接口一致；每个有限图仅使用有限多个非空颜色关系，所以覆盖原书的有限着色扩张。没有给语言偷偷加入顶点顺序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_k\">\\(\\mathsf C_k\\)</span> 只是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a> 语法及满足关系的句子接口；完整满足递归不在这里另行重定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","s