\mathcal K\\;\\operatorname{Char}_{\\mathcal L,r}(G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_s^{C_k}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau_s],\\qquad\nM_s^{C_k}\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\times\\mathcal S_s^{C_k}\\mid\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_C\\varphi[\\beta]\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf C_k\\coloneqq(\\mathcal S_s^{C_k},M_s^{C_k})_{s\\in\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"s\\geq r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_k","display":false}],"bytes":2900,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-graph-characterization]]、[[29-thm-colored-forest-c2]] — 全部有限着色扩张下的图刻画与彩色森林"},{"id":"531861035d8c6707","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$；$\\mathsf C_2$、$\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}$ 和 $\\operatorname{CharClass}$ 取 [[29-df-graph-characterization]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-graph-characterization]]"},{"id":"ef134b4589bf7f20","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-graph-characterization|29-df-graph-characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["dd6d5729a326908a","3a603dc4f41b07de","587fa3c5f12ce89b","ac5c4072279f0088"]}